==English==

===Conjunction===
'''[[let]] [[alone]]''' (''in nonassertive contexts'')
# {{idiom}} (where the first element is more likely than, or implies, the second)  [[much less]]; to say nothing of.
#: ''I didn't even notice it, '''let alone''' care.''
# {{idiom}}{{proscribed}} (where the second element is more likely than, or implies, the first) or even
#: ''I doubt if there are twenty, '''let alone''' ten.''

